{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04974","headline":"蜀中言怀 · 王适","name":"蜀中言怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独坐年将暮，常怀志不通。\n有时须问影，无事却书空。\n弃置如天外，平生似梦中。\n蓬心犹是客，华髪欲成翁。\n迹滞魂逾窘，情乖路转穷。\n别离同夜月，愁思隔秋风。\n老少悲颜驷，盈虚悟翟公。\n时来不可问，何用求童蒙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04974.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04974","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}